  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien anime-opening J-rock anthem with J-pop harmony. Bright overdriven rhythm guitar under clean arpeggiated single-coil lead lines; piano doubling the main hook; synth strings and synth brass layered on the chorus; electric bass running eighth notes with fills; drums with sixteenth-note hi-hats, a four-on-the-floor kick in the pre-chorus and a driving eight-beat chorus with a crash on every bar, never a two-beat punk feel. IV-V-iii-vi progressions and a half-step key change into the last chorus. Polished, wide and dense, the lead vocal forward over the band. High clear male tenor belting long held notes with anime-opening intensity, hopeful and driving. 176 BPM, D major rising to E flat major. Absurdly heroic about one cockroach in the kitchen. No punk gang shouts, no blues guitar, no guitar solo, no trap drums, no autotune, no enka-style weeping.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n暗時十點 灶跤的電火一下開\n冰箱邊 兩枝鬚 咧振動\n阿母佮小妹 覕佇我的尻脊後\n「你是查埔的 你去」\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n殺蟲劑 捏佇手內\n跤咧顫 手袂使顫\n\n[Chorus]\n虼蚻!我毋驚你\n今仔暗 我是這間厝的英雄\n你若飛過來\n我 毋走\n\n[Verse]\n噴一擺 伊閃入去冰箱跤\n噴兩擺 伊對壁頂蹈起去\n噴三擺 伊的翼股拍開矣\n伊 對我的面 飛過來\n\n[Chorus]\n虼蚻!我毋驚你\n我喝甲規條巷仔攏聽著\n你歇佇我的胸坎頂\n我 猶是 毋走\n\n[Outro]\n伊 反肚 佇塗跤\n阿母講「後擺 嘛你來」",
